.TH KINTSUGI-TASTE 1 "2026-10-22" "kintsugi 0.8.0" "Kintsugi Manual"
.SH NAME
kintsugi-taste \- operator taste preferences
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kintsugi taste
list [\-\-json]
.br
.B kintsugi taste
open
.br
.B kintsugi taste
lint
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage operator taste preferences. Taste is local-only: no remote sync, no
model-authored policy. Every accept/reject/edit of a proposed change becomes a
local signal.
.SH COMMANDS
.IP \fBlist\fR
Show taste bullets, project + global
.IP \fBopen\fR
Print the taste file path and content
.IP \fBlint\fR
Reject bullets without a date or kind
.SH OPTIONS
.IP \fB\-\-json\fR
Output as JSON
.SH EXAMPLES
List preferences:
.PP
  $ kintsugi taste list
.PP
Open taste file:
.PP
  $ kintsugi taste open
.PP
Validate taste file:
.PP
  $ kintsugi taste lint
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kintsugi (1)
